    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/4/64559.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "Last night, Joe Biden gave his first official State of the Union address. There were the usual proclamations such as the State of the Union is strong. What did you think of his speech and is the State of the Union strong?",
