    "turn_text": "You often hear the Democrats talk about following the science. And so I try to. On this COVID thing, I have followed every statistic I can get my hands on that is from a legitimate source. And with the CDC has all kinds of statistics, but there are studies all over the world, including Johns Hopkins University. And with the honor-cron variant, Let me try that again with the Omicron variant. What they found was statistically speaking, those who had had COVID before, regardless of their vaccine status, had the strongest fight against, had the least likelihood of being reinfected, statistically speaking. And yet you mentioned the military and there are people being discharged, able, intelligent people being discharged from the military, even if they've already had COVID, they've got the antibodies doing its thing just the way God intended. But no, I'm sorry, we're going to kick you out because you haven't put this substance in your body. It just absolutely kills me. But more importantly, it's ignoring the science.",
