    "turn_text": "Let me ask you, and this is not intended to be mean-spirited in any way. But when I think of Vladimir Putin, and he's an evil man, he's a bad man, but he projects strength, not necessarily in a good way. But he projects strength. When I picture our president, the president of the United States, the leader of the free world, Joe Biden, sitting down across the table from Vladimir Putin, I don't feel like there's equal strength on both sides of the table.",
